before the download is agreed to.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Claude Code and the Agent SDK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk, and the per-platform packages carrying the
`claude` binary that it spawns
  (c) Anthropic PBC. All rights reserved. Use is subject to the Legal
  Agreements at https://code.claude.com/docs/en/legal-and-compliance.
  https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-typescript

Open Room ships no Anthropic credentials. Every model call is made through
this SDK on behalf of the Claude Code account logged in on the user's
machine and is billed to that account.

